{"id":"brick-lane","name":"Brick Lane","qid":"Q1194528","country":"United Kingdom","locality":"London Borough of Tower Hamlets","lat":"51.521944444","lon":"-0.071666666","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Date not recorded","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"street; ethnic enclave; restaurant district","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brick_Lane","text":"Brick Lane (Bengali: ব্রিক লেন, romanized: Brik Len) is a street in the East End of London, in the borough of Tower Hamlets. It runs from Swanfield Street in Bethnal Green in the north, crosses the Bethnal Green Road before reaching the busiest, most commercially active part which runs through Spitalfields, or along its eastern edge. Brick Lane's southern end is connected to Whitechapel High Street by a short extension called Osborn Street.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brick_Lane","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-9941f205f851","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"London, UK - panoramio (554).jpg","o":"gh-9941f205f851.jpg","credit":{"text":"Tabraiz Feham","license":"CC BY 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:London%2C_UK_-_panoramio_%28554%29.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}},{"id":"gh-9f9d377632bc","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"Brick Lane London.JPG","o":"gh-9f9d377632bc.jpg","credit":{"text":"Gons","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brick_Lane_London.JPG","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"watch-dogs-legion--brick-lane","game":"watch-dogs-legion","name":"Brick Lane","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-0327836565c7","w":1200,"h":750,"o":"gh-0327836565c7.webp","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Watch Dogs: Legion, © Ubisoft Toronto; Ubisoft Paris; Ubisoft Kyiv; Ubisoft Reflections.","source":"https://watchd